5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I need to understand how a new holding impacts our quarter-end reporting accuracy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The talent pipeline is my primary worry. Who can we actually place this month?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am curious about the stories we tell versus the real customer retention data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to see the cash flow projections for the years following the initial round.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to know what external factors have historically delayed our portfolio companies' launches.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, are those projections based on audited figures or just management estimates?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, delays are common, but I worry about the people who cause them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I agree. The gap between narrative and reality is where we lose trust.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, I am looking for the borrowing capacity we retain after the first year.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, I am not interested in blame, but in the specific nature of the bottlenecks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will focus on the audit requirements and the independent verification of our current holdings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the retained recruiters and the specific terms of our last credit line.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will examine the account retention through price rises and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will investigate the reserve accounts and the terms of last winter's credit line.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look into the security review time and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
