35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The audit findings are clear. Hardware and field instruments need outside appraisals, adding six weeks and fees.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, that timeline is tight. My recruiter data shows field crews take four months to place.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I see the same pattern. The bank-cycle tool never missed a release, but the hardware one lost five months.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, the audit delay is a problem, but the credit line terms are worse.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, the security review is the real bottleneck. Three quarters for regulated customers is unacceptable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, the security review is a delay, but the audit is a cost and a time sink.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, the credit line is useless for a company with no inventory. It only helps if we sell stock.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
